+    Veusz 4.2.1 puts on a date axis from ``minval`` to ``maxval`` Veusz
+    seconds (0.0.31; port of veusz/widgets/axisticks.py
+    DateTicks.bestTickFinder; ``extendmin``/``extendmax``: "next-tick")."""
